   ],
   "textLength": 209,
   "text": "Outdoor educator Gabe Giffin is concerned about potential impacts on local wildlife from the SpaceX rocket facility in Vermilion Parish, Louisiana.\n Kathleen Flynn\n hide caption\n toggle caption\n Kathleen Flynn",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 969,
    "height": 65,
    "widthFraction": 0.45,
    "leftFraction": 0.15,
    "pageFraction": 0.09,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "tag": "p×4",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 584,
   "text": "The center of the small town of Abbeville, La., near the Gulf of Mexico, was closed off to the public for a few hours last month to hold an invitation-only event.\nExecutives, developers and politicians met in an event venue often used for weddings. There they watched an action-movie-style video depicting Elon Musk landing in a helicopter to a techno-music soundtrack. Waiting for him was Republican",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 4,
    "repeats": 4,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 1084,
    "height": 307,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.1,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 9,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 473,
   "text": "Musk's SpaceX says it's building a 125,000-acre facility that could launch about 30 rockets per day — thousands per year. It's part of the company's plans to expand the Starlink satellite internet service and potentially power data centers in space.\nLouisiana Economic Development, a state agency, says the facility will include five launch complexes and housing for employees and their families. In ",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0.06,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 1784,
    "height": 210,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.17,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "tag": "h3",
   "class": "edTag",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 49,
   "text": "Nondisclosure agreements and aerospace exemptions",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 1,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 2029,
    "height": 28,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.19,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 11,
   "tag": "p×4",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 786,
   "text": "The announcement event wasn't the only exclusive part of the deal, which the state says brings $100 billion in investment.\nAfter the video, Landry took the stage and thanked state lawmakers, including some who signed nondisclosure agreements over negotiations for the deal. The agreements, obtained in records requests by the Gulf States Newsroom, were under the codename, \"Project Osprey.\"\nReporting",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 4,
    "repeats": 4,
    "coverLinks": 1
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0.07,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 2066,
    "height": 415,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.19,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 12,
   "tag": "div",
   "class": "credit-caption",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 332,
   "text": "SpaceX President and COO Gwynne Shotwell, (left) speaks with Louisiana Gov. Jeff Landry and Secretary of Louisiana Economic Development Susan Bourgeois during an event with SpaceX announcing a deal to build a new spaceport in Louisiana on Aug. 25 in Abbeville, La.\n Gerald Herbert/AP\n hide caption\n toggle caption\n Gerald Herbert/AP",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 2936,
    "height": 83,
    "widthFraction": 0.45,
    "leftFraction": 0.15,
    "pageFraction": 0.28,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 13,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 211,
   "text": "\"You think I want Texas to steal my thunder? You think I want other states to know what we're working on?\" Landry said. \"Quite frankly, that's what has continued to happen to Louisiana before I became governor.\"",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3069,
    "height": 81,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.29,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 14,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 516,
   "text": "Landry also signed new laws exempting aerospace companies from property taxes, liability and nuisance claims related to noise, vibrations, heat exhaust and sonic booms and public records laws. SpaceX is covered in those exemptions.\nRecords from Louisiana Economic Development show that in exchange for SpaceX paying the Vermilion Parish government about $25 million annually, the company avoids payin",
   "counts": {
    "links": 4,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0.26,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3543,
    "height": 237,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.33,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 15,
   "tag": "h3",
   "class": "edTag",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 38,
   "text": "\"He didn't ask anybody,\" resident says",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 1,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3815,
    "height": 28,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.36,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 16,
   "tag": "p×6",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 1034,
   "text": "The site of the future spaceport is about a 45-minute drive south from Abbeville. Residents in the area of nearby Pecan Island are concerned.\nKim Nehrbass, who has a hunting and fishing camp on Pecan Island, said the coastal marsh is a \"paradise.\" Nehrbass watched the SpaceX announcement on a livestream.\n\"[Landry] is thanking everybody for making it happen. He didn't ask anybody if they wanted to ",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 6,
    "repeats": 6,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3852,
    "height": 538,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.36,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 17,
   "tag": "div",
   "class": "credit-caption",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 173,
   "text": "A view of Pecan Island in Vermilion Parish, Louisiana, where SpaceX announced it is building a rocket facility.\n Kathleen Flynn\n hide caption\n toggle caption\n Kathleen Flynn",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 4845,
    "height": 47,
    "widthFraction": 0.45,
    "leftFraction": 0.15,
    "pageFraction": 0.46,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 18,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 407,
   "text": "\"Now the birds might fly away during a launch, but I guarantee they'll come back,\" Shotwell said. \"And they come back right away, by the way. As soon as the rocket's gone, the birds come back. It's not like months later.\"\nNearby resident Brooke Broussard said she and her friends watched the livestream of the announcement. \"Why would the birds come back?\" she said. \"They're smarter than us, in some",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 4942,
    "height": 183,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.46,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 19,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 176,
   "text": "Broussard said she knows the project isn't going to be stopped. The deal, as far as she and her neighbors can tell, was finalized before anyone in Pecan Island had a say in it.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 5518,
    "height": 81,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.52,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 20,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 253,
   "text": "She choked up talking about what the area means to her.\n\"This is my source in a lot of ways,\" she said. \"My life source, where I came from, where I was conceived, and I find a lot of strength here and I find a lot of strength in my family history here.\"",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 5620,
    "height": 129,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.14,
    "pageFraction": 0.53,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 21,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 117,
   "text": "\"I don't want the story to just be: 'Elon Musk came and conquered,'\" she said. \"I want the other stories to be told.\"",
